<title>JAPAN: Japan external reserves in Feb record $218.26 bln.</title>
<headline>Japan external reserves in Feb record $218.26 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's external reserves rose $1.12 billion from a month earlier in February to a record $218.26 billion, the Ministry of Finance said on Monday.</p>
<p>The reserves had fallen $731 million in January from a month earlier to $217.14 billion.</p>
<p>The previous record high was $217.867 bln set in December 1996.</p>
<p>Figures may not tally due to rounding.</p>
</text>
